## Branch Strategy

```
main        ← production (protected, requires PR + CI green)
develop     ← staging / integration branch
feature/*   ← individual features, PRs target develop
hotfix/*    ← urgent fixes, PRs target main directly
```

### Protect `main`

Go to **Settings → Branches → Add rule** for `main`:

- ✅ Require a pull request before merging
- ✅ Require status checks to pass (select `Backend – Lint & Test` and `Frontend – Lint, Test & Build`)
- ✅ Require branches to be up to date before merging
- ✅ Do not allow bypassing the above settings

---

## Local Development

CI runs the same commands locally — keep them green before pushing:

```bash
# Backend
cd backend
npm ci
npm run lint
npm test

# Frontend
cd frontend
npm ci
npm run lint
npm test -- --watchAll=false
npm run build
```

