## Deployment Targets (free tiers)

| Service | What | Free tier |
|---------|------|-----------|
| [Vercel](https://vercel.com) | Frontend (React) | ✅ Hobby plan |
| [Railway](https://railway.app) | Backend (Express) + MongoDB | ✅ Starter $5/mo credit |
| [MongoDB Atlas](https://cloud.mongodb.com) | Database | ✅ 512 MB free cluster |

> **Alternative:** Replace Railway with [Render](https://render.com) — same secrets pattern, change `railway up` to a Render deploy hook curl in `cd.yml`.
